    <li><a rel="noopener noreferrer" rel="noopener noreferrer" name="2" id="2"></a>Daniel Dias and Jo&atilde;o B. Duarte, <a rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/full/10.1002/jae.2679" target="_blank">&ldquo;Monetary Policy, Housing Rents, and Inflation Dynamics,&rdquo; Journal of Applied Econometrics (January 2019)</a>.</li>
</ol>
</div>
</div>

